From 6be46906d069787f3305aa7661d2c55fa118e78c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ManicardiMatteo87 <manicardi.matteo87@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 19:52:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 19/19] perf(motion): F3+G2s candidate, G2 with two functions
 back in flash (P0)

cb9ed85 (F3 + G2) stopped on the 24 KB heap threshold in its hardware session
(16/11). Same change as the G2s branch: contactInverseKinematicsGroundNormal and
validGaitParameters lose MATDOG_MOTION_HOT (-4.1 KB IRAM, +4 KB internal heap),
their source-gate pins are updated, and the composition note names G2s. F3 is
unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
